    "privateProtocol": "haiyue.audio.game-lease.v1",
    "rationale": "The original mixer maintains a bounded set of actual live voice IDs for each facade and removes them on natural end/eviction. GameAudio holds emitter configuration only and cannot update or stop a foreign same-channel replacement. There is no second node registry, decoder, cache, sample clock or context.",
